     A* Key fields and access path keywords.
     A* Member: PFKEYS   Compilable: yes
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for physical and logical files,
     A*   key field level keyword entries. Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
     A* File-level keywords controlling the access path.
00010A                                      UNIQUE
00020A                                      FIFO
00030A                                      ALTSEQ(QSYS/QCASE256)
     A*
00040A          R ACCOUNT
00050A            ACLEVELID      2P 0
00060A            ACNAME        20A
00070A            BALANCE       11P 2
     A*
     A* Key-level keywords apply to the key field above them.
00080A          K ACNAME
00090A          K BALANCE                   DESCEND
00100A          K ACLEVELID                 ABSVAL
00110A          K ACLEVELID                 SIGNED
00120A          K ACLEVELID                 UNSIGNED
00130A          K ACNAME                    ZONE
00140A          K ACNAME                    DIGIT
00150A          K ACNAME                    NOALTSEQ
     A*
     A* The alternatives to FIFO for duplicate key sequencing.
00160A                                      LIFO
00170A                                      FCFO
